      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEDERAL ARLO (1) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a strong early split, giving a sight but fading only late to finish second (17.34) at this track over 300m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Sure to be about the mark. FOXY SIN (2) missed the frame last time but prior to that was an effortless Grade 6 winner (17.19) at this track, scoring by 2.75 lengths. Well placed here and can atone this time. BODAK YELLOW (3) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 400m behind West On Pash (23.18) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money the start prior. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. DEFENDER (7) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
